==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|schif}}, from {{inh|de|goh|skif}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*skipą}}.
{{rel-top|cognates}}
Cognate with {{cog|nds|Schipp}}, {{cog|fy|skip}}, {{cog|nl|schip}}, {{cog|yi|שיף|tr=shif}}, {{cog|en|ship}}, {{cog|da|skib}}, {{cog|sv|skepp}}. Related also to Lithuanian {{m|lt|skiẽbti||to rip up}}, Latvian {{m|lv|skibit|škibît|to cut, lop}}.
{{rel-bottom}}

